  "instagram_caption": "How blackjack works, in under a minute.\n\nGet closer to 21 than the dealer without going over. Face cards count 10, an ace is 1 or 11, and you hit or stand. The catch: you play first, so if you bust you lose even when the dealer busts too. That rule is where most of the casino's edge comes from.\n\nEducation only. Not gambling advice. 18+\n\nWhich casino game should Ace explain next?\n\n#theriggedgame #blackjack #howtoplay #casino #cardgames",
